WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.360
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.310
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.080
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.280
Hoshimiya.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:15.530
Yes?

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.290
I want you to be my partner from now on.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.840
So it was just a dream.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.940
Ichigo! This is big news!

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.300
It's bigger than big!{+pun?}

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.430
What is it, Aoi?

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.430
Just take a look at this!

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.550
An announcement from the academy?

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:46.440
Let's see. "An elimination audition will be held for Kanzaki Mizuki's new idol unit" ...What?!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:51.440
That's right! If you pass this audition, you'll be able to form a unit with Mizuki-san!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:36.550
I will now be announcing the particulars of my new idol unit.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.440
Including myself, it will consist of three members.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:44.150
The unit name will be "Tristar".

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:51.310
Kanzaki-san, you've enjoyed immense popularity working solo up until now,

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.230
so what spurred your sudden decision to form a group?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:03:00.070
Right now, Starlight Academy is full of brightly shining students.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:07.580
If you had watched them as I had, then I'm sure you would understand why I would want to form a unit.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.300
As this will be your first official formation of a group,

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.560
how will you choose the other members?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.590
Of course, there will be an audition.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.150
There is only one requirement to apply:

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.870
To be a student of Starlight Academy.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:24.850
I will choose my two partners from among them.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:29.270
Please look forward to it.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.410
Tristar...

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:33.180
She'll only choose two of us...

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:35.140
Aoi, Ran, let's do our best.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.800
Yeah, the most important thing is to give our all.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.580
No matter what happens, we'll still be friends.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:45.870
I'm sure you are all aware that this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance to join the ranks of top idol.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.010
However, the road is long and rugged,

00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:51.280
and as this is Starlight Academy's—no,

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:56.020
the entire idol world's top idol Kanzaki Mizuki's first unit,

00:03:56.020 --> 00:04:00.080
the audition will present a greater challenge than any you have faced before.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:03.350
The audition will be held in one week.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:06.010
Train as if your life were on the line and leave no regrets.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.530
Yes!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.810
Hey! If you want me you're going to have to calm down—

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:15.480
Now.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:25.800
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.110
Everyone's already here.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.330
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:34.160
Wow! Otome-chan and Sakura-chan are running so hard!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.710
Aikatsu... Aikatsu...

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.710
Even <i>Yurika's</i> running!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:44.220
Looks like things have started to get interesting. {yay generic}

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.220
I never thought that Mizuki-san would ever form a unit.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.290
Hikari!

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.220
Hikari-chan.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.350
So bright...

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.360
Hikari, you're entering?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.140
Don't give me that look, Ran.

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.580
I have no intention of auditioning.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:08.190
All my fans want to see is me, the brightly shining sun.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.370
Isn't that right?

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.650
Yeah. You're the underground sun, after all.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:16.870
I'll be watching how much you've polished your skills from down under.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.750
Don't let me down.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:23.950
Let's go!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:24.470
Ran!

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:25.260
Wait up!

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.810
It's finally time, Mizuki.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:35.270
<i>I always believed</i>

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.270
<i>that we'd be able to meet if I came here. {change entire thing?}</i>

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.830
This year's Starlight Queen is the super first-year:

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.810
Kanzaki Mizuki!

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.300
<i>Please, show me...</i>

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:05.300
<i>The birth of a bright new star!</i>

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:10.510
Hey, what sort of unit do you all want to form with Mizuki-san?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.220
Here!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:16.230
Otome wants to spread love with Mizuki all across the world!

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:19.230
Together, we would live eternally

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:22.190
as the most beautiful vampire clan.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.770
Together we would spread the traditions of yore

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:27.190
and glorify the world of idols.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.200
Those all sound so good. But come to think of it...

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:36.630
They said this was Mizuki-san's first unit, but hasn't she been in any team auditions before?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.530
I'm not quite sure.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:43.210
She was already considered a top idol by the time we entered this school.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.580
As far as I know, she never participated in one.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:47.590
But she has.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:52.720
Even though Mizuki-san became the Starlight Queen right after entering the Academy...

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:57.060
She soon entered an audition with her classmates

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:02.240
Ichihara Ichika-chan, Nishijima Nino-chan, and Miura Sango-chan.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.980
Unfortunately, they didn't pass.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.730
They didn't? But why?

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:14.490
Mizuki-san was at such a high level that the other three couldn't keep up.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:19.240
Since then, Mizuki-san has been climbing the stairs of the idol world by herself,

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:22.040
and always got offers for gigs directly.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.850
She really is amazing.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:29.010
But if I was in her shoes, I think I'd be lonely.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.280
Lonely?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.720
Yeah. The six of us are always training together,

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.390
but standing at the top means that you're always alone, right? {let those winds blow}

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.650
I guess so...

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:41.620
That reminds me of something I once heard.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.770
In entertainment, the deeper you go, the more isolated you become. {In this world? Among idols?} {it's fine}

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.450
Don't forget what Mizuki-san said.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:53.890
Right now, Starlight Academy is full of brightly shining students.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:59.960
The reason she announced her new unit is because there are those among us who caught her eye!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.250
Mizuki-san...

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.290
Ichigo-tan?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.300
I'm gonna go for a run!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.050
<i>I'll keep biting onto you.</i>

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.960
<i>I won't let go until I've reached your level!</i>

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.490
Are you sure about this?

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:20.300
About what?

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:24.060
About how you're really going to judge all the applicants by yourself.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.760
It won't just be your underclassmen participating.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:30.230
You're going to have to fail girls that may even be your classmates.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.000
I suppose I will.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.470
We're sorry, Mizuki.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:39.080
All because we couldn't keep up with you...

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.530
I'm prepared to do it.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:45.540
I want to take in everyone's feelings myself.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.810
The time has finally come!

00:08:55.810 --> 00:09:00.600
It's the elimination audition for 
Kanzaki Mizuki's first unit, Tristar!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.330
The whole country's got their eyes on today's audition,

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:08.110
so we will provide you with an exclusive live broadcast on scene from Starlight Academy.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.600
You can do it, Aoi-neesan! You too, Onee-chan!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.360
The audition will begin from the first stage,

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:21.370
and end here at the specially prepared live stage on the fields.

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:26.370
Each stage will feature trials designed personally by Kanzaki-san.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:30.380
She herself has said these are the walls one must overcome to become top idol!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.880
Look forward to it!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.280
So Mizuki-san...

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.770
...thought up these trials.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:35.680
There's no doubt...

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.390
...that they won't be easy.

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:38.390
Alright!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:41.390
Let's all aim to get to the live stage together!

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.390
Yeah!

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.830
Now then, have you said your prayers, honeys?

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.900
Ready... go!

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:55.500
The curtain has finally been raised on the first event! {raised?}

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.660
The first stage is...

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:06.410
Are we supposed to climb this?

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.420
So it's begun.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:12.920
I wonder if you'll make it past this first wall.

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:24.690
Up they go!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:29.270
The idols are climbing the wall to reach the very top!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.560
Don't let go, Aoi-neesan!

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.450
This kind of thing is my specialty.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.480
Otome's not going to lose!

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:41.660
E-Even if I must endure the fires of the sun,

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.830
there's no way I'd let something like this defeat me.

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.750
This height isn't anything to sneeze at. {so you finally did it}

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.250
Just what was Mizuki-sama thinking?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:57.510
She didn't choose this randomly. I'm sure there's some meaning behind this.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.010
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:05.780
Almost there... huh?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.660
Is it raining?

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.570
Wall-climbing idols. Th-This is great!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.000
Suzukawa-kun, let them have it!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.280
Kanzaki Mizuki sure doesn't hold back.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.170
That's it!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.750
An overwhelming 200 girls have dropped out.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:39.800
Only 50 have made it to the next stage.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:43.140
Thank goodness, everyone managed to pass.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.760
Yes, somehow...

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.310
You've got more guts than I gave you credit for.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:54.770
It's all your fault for dragging me along with your training.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:01.280
It's now time for the Golden Mizuki Chance!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.670
Golden Mizuki Chance?

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:10.650
For this event, simply passing each challenge does not guarantee that you will pass the entire audition.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:16.310
This audition exists to determine whether you have the right to stand on the stage as Tristar.

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:20.140
If Kanzaki-san judges you to be worthy...

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.840
You will pass without further challenge!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.680
That means we can pass the audition at any point now.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.870
Everyone, let's meet again after the second stage.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.950
But the Golden Mizuki Chance...

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:39.690
Nobody made it... phooey.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:44.570
From here on out, I won't give up until I'm chosen by Mizuki-san!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:55.790
Aikatsu... Aikatsu...

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.440
Don't look down!

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.040
R-Right!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.550
The balancing bar is as wide as usual.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:06.050
As long as you don't look down, then there's nothing to wor—

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:09.690
Okay! Fire off those volleyballs like nobody's business!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:11.870
She's really got no mercy.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:25.760
Michelle?

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.020
Aw man, I fell off too.

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.410
Did you jump because of me?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.480
If we're not together, then there's no point in going on.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.580
Michelle...

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.830
D-Did Mizuki-sama do this too?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.590
If you get hit it'll leave a mark!

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:45.090
No way, they're doing the Golden Mizuki Chance now?

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:50.100
Mizuki-san...

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.480
"Is that all you've got?"

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:56.100
Forget about passing, we're not even impressing her. {leaving an impression}

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:57.730
Okay!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:04.550
Well? Think you can find someone who meets your standards?

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:06.080
I wonder.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:10.560
Thirty have overcome the terrifying second stage.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:12.330
The next stage is...

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.330
A rodeo song!

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:18.800
Looks like you pass if you can finish a song without being thrown off the mechanical bull.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.340
I'll try it out first!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:32.180
I-I've gotta sing...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:36.010
Is this really a trial that you need to face to become top idol?

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:38.630
I can't follow Mizuki-san's train of thought at all.

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.060
Complete!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.340
Twenty girls have made it to the next stage.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:46.130
W-We did it...

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:48.780
All of us made it...

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:51.700
Sakura-chan, you alright?

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.930
Forgive me for worrying you.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:59.160
And we're up to the fourth stage!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.920
And now it's wind?!

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.340
I-I can't hold on much longer...

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.920
Then feel free to leave right now.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.430
We're in the middle of a serious battle...

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.310
If you dare to complain, I'll suck your blood!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:17.850
Yurika-sama!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.640
Yurika-tan's parasol is—!

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:24.310
Let it go! You're gonna be blown away like that!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.740
Th-This parasol is...

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:30.820
my precious companion who protects my vampiric body from the sun...

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:36.080
I'm going to pass this audition as Toudou Yurika...

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.370
Just you wait!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.330
Yurika-sama!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.270
How dare you blow me away!

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:45.380
No matter what kind of fan you are, I'll suck your blood!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:50.620
No matter what the situation she refuses to give up her character... Toudou Yurika.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:51.840
Quite impressive.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.720
Everyone, don't let Yurika-chan's efforts go to waste!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.600
Okay!

00:15:57.190 --> 00:16:00.770
The reason I prepared these nearly impossible trials

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:05.270
was to determine which of you had the potential to become top idol.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:08.760
Against those odds, you put forth your best efforts

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:13.350
and showed me the strong will hidden behind your suffering faces.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.810
Idols are so amazing...

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:19.910
That they are.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:23.880
Through all the happiness and despair, we've reached their last chance!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.920
The live concert!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:29.930
The piece you will be performing is Tristar's debut song.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:32.350
I trust that you've all prepared?

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:32.930
Yes!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.960
Well then, I hope you don't mind us going first.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:36.850
Not at all.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.630
Mizuki really set the bar way too high.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:46.070
It just means that we're not quite there yet.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:48.370
No matter what happens, this is our last shot.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:51.410
Let's show her everything we've done in these last two years!

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:52.440
Okay!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.340
Aoi?

00:16:54.340 --> 00:17:00.140
Those three were the girls who entered a team audition with Mizuki-san two years ago.

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.160
As the top shines more and more brightly,

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:08.340
the unceasing efforts of those chasing after her burn even brighter as well.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.410
The same goes for you.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:17.850
Those older honeys have been chasing after Mizuki for longer than anyone else, and their efforts will not go unseen.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:19.010
They won't be easy to beat.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:36.590
Ready?

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:37.700
Yeah!

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:04.570
And that concludes the live audition!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:10.870
Will Tristar's members finally be chosen during this Golden Mizuki Chance?

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.300
Final audition?

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.970
You all showed me the best possible stage.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:30.270
However, what I'm searching for is beyond that—the ultimate stage.

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:34.480
Therefore, I'm going to hold the final audition tomorrow.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.480
Those who have earned the right to stand there are...

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.320
These six!

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:50.840
From among you six, I'm going to choose the two who will join me as Tristar.

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:53.450
No! I won't let you have your way!

00:21:57.890 --> 00:22:00.000
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.490
Let's Aikatsu!

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:07.980
Yes, this aura!

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:10.720
Miss Kanzaki is down there!

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:19.810
Mizuki-san?

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:01.500
Yurika-tan, you flew so high up in the air!

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.090
It wasn't a big deal.

00:24:03.090 --> 00:24:05.340
It took two whole hours to walk back though...

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:07.420
So cool!

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:09.880
Hold the parasol with all your might.

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:12.260
Hi, everyone at Starlight!

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:13.720
Wow, what an aura!

